<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 04.176  Barion Rectangle CC AW-19</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Wolkonsky, Alexandre (Van Sant), Wolkonsky Faceting</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Designs, Jun 95, p19. One of a series of L/W variations</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">of which 07.121 is the L/W=1.0 version.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.770</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">49 facets + 8 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.200  T/W = 0.735  U/W = 0.535</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.604 C/W = 0.143</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.409</tspan>
